---
---

<section id="about" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-gold/10 blur-3xl"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center md:px-8 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="reveal overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/reception.webp"
          alt="Reception at Makdesi And Associates Lawyers, 705 Sydney Road Brunswick"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover md:aspect-[3/4]"
          width="2000"
          height="1400"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7">
      <p class="section-label reveal">About the firm</p>
      <h2
        class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-5 font-display text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl"
      >
        A Brunswick practice built on trust
      </h2>
      <p
        class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate md:text-xl"
      >
        Makdesi And Associates Lawyers are dedicated to providing friendly,
        experienced guidance across estate planning, probate, wills, business,
        and property law. We pride ourselves on getting the results you want —
        efficiently and cost-effectively — whilst building long and lasting
        relationships with our clients.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-slate">
        Led by Principal <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Mary Makdesi</strong
        >, our growing team handles litigation, commercial, family, criminal,
        immigration, and building/planning matters. Located in the heart of
        Brunswick, we’re close to local and city courts — and ready to travel
        when clients need us.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#team"
        class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-gold-deep no-underline transition-colors hover:text-ink"
      >
        Meet the team
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path
            d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
